<article class="ltx_document">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">AgentDropoutV2: Optimizing Information Flow in Multi-Agent Systems 
<br class="ltx_break">via Test-Time Rectify-or-Reject Pruning</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Yutong Wang
