<span id="A1.F5.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F5.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Name: SQUARE_ROOT_MANIPULATION_CHECK:
<br class="ltx_break">Detailed Definition: This error occurs when mathematical expressions in radical form are manipulated in a way that leads to logical contradictions relating to divisibility or integer properties.
<br class="ltx_break">Trigger Condition: When the agent performs manipulations involving expressions in radical form and calculations involving divisibility and integer properties.
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
